<p class="citation">Prioul, R., Bakulin, A., Bakulin, V. (2004). Nonlinear rock physics model for estimation of 3D subsurface stress in anisotropic formations: Theory and laboratory verification. Geophysics 69(2), 415-425. <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://doi.org/10.1190/1.1707061">doi:10.1190/1.1707061</a></p>
